title: "Bioelectric Depolarization as a Topological Defect: A Zero-Free Sparse-Polynomial Engine for Candidate Bioelectromagnetic Field Synthesis"
abstract: "A deterministic computational framework that maps membrane potential and boundary fractal dimension to a candidate bioelectromagnetic stimulus specification, with a pre-registration draft for an in vitro specificity protocol. Theoretical/computational only; no clinical efficacy claim."
